# Keep line endings out of the diffs.
* text=auto

# gofmt only understands LF. Without this, cloning on Windows checks the
# files out with CRLF and every single one shows up as unformatted, which
# then tempts somebody into running gofmt -w and rewriting the whole
# repository for nothing.
*.go text eol=lf

# Same reason: the catalogues are compared byte for byte by the tests.
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
